#!/bin/sh
set -eu
printf 'Mode: '
cat /sys/bus/platform/devices/1fff8080.keyboard/key_mode
cat <<'MAP'
aaA1: toggle letters / symbols
Symbols mode (Shift gives the lower row):
 Q W E R T Y U I O P
 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 0
 ! @ # $ % ^ & * ( )

 A S D F G H J K
 - = [ ] \ ; ' `
 _ + { } | : " ~

 Z X C     L: Tab
 , . /     B V N M: unassigned
 < > ?

Shift: uppercase / shifted symbol
Voice: Ctrl (use letters mode for Ctrl+C)
MAP
